---
source: tests/surface_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(&[verb])"
---
Mint a note

Usage: mnemex new [OPTIONS] <KIND> <TITLE>

Arguments:
  <KIND>   The kind, which is the folder it lands in
  <TITLE>  The title. Its slug becomes half the id

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>  The project this note belongs to
      --status <STATUS>    The status, for plan and adr
      --tag <TAG>          A tag. Repeat for more
      --ref <URL>          A work-item URL. Repeat for more
      --path <DIR>         The directory a project's work happens in. A relative path is taken from the working directory
      --repo <REMOTE>      The repository a project is. Any spelling of a remote; stored canonically. Derived from `--path` when that is a checkout
  -h, --help               Print help
